### Title only
GET http://localhost:8083/jobs/search?title=java
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### All filters + sort
GET http://localhost:8083/jobs/search?title=java&remote=true&jobType=FULL_TIME&minSalary=80000&sortBy=minSalary&direction=DESC&page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}